DESCRIPTION:Are you looking for a quiet space to study after school? Join 
 our quiet study hall at Locke's program room every Thursday for individual
  or group study. Tables and chairs are provided\, as well as a variety of
  materials to take study breaks.\nThis is a drop-in program for Teens\, a
 nd space is limited.
LOCATION:Locke\, Program Room
