UID:69b570da67801235ed71f6bd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to mix\, stretch\, and squish! Join us for a hands-o
 n slime-making program where participants will learn the basics of simple 
 science while creating their very own batch of slime to take home. We’ll
  explore textures\, colors\, and fun chemical reactions in a safe and supe
 rvised environment. All materials will be provided—just bring your curio
 sity and be ready to get a little messy!
LOCATION:Humber Summit\, Auditorium\, Lower level
