SUMMARY:Family Movies - Piece by Piece
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T150000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T170000Z
UID:69bd696fe2a2952aed097dca@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Every other Saturday Cliffcrest will be screening a free famil
 y friendly movie!\nThis month's movie:\nPiece by Piece\nA unique cinematic
  experience that invites audiences on a vibrant journey through the life o
 f cultural icon Pharrell Williams. Told through the lens of LEGO animation
 \, turn up the volume on your imagination and witness the evolution of one
  of music's most innovative minds.
LOCATION:Cliffcrest
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69bd696fe2a2952aed097dca
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Movies - Zootopia 2
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260411T150000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260411T170000Z
UID:69bd69f0e2a2952aed097e42@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Every other Saturday Cliffcrest will be screening a free famil
 y friendly movie!\nThis months' movie:\nZootopia 2\nDetectives Judy Hopps 
 and Nick Wilde find themselves on the twisting trail of a mysterious repti
 le who arrives in Zootopia and turns the mammal metropolis upside down. To
  crack the case\, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts
  of town\, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.
LOCATION:Cliffcrest
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69bd69f0e2a2952aed097e42
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
