DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260605T190000Z
UID:69c6d08f8d5e2d093367ffa9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join children’s author Sarabeth Holden for a reading of her 
 book\nBenny the Bananasaurus Rex\n\, followed by an interactive creative w
 riting workshop. For children ages 3-8.\nNo registration required. Groups
  of five or more are asked to contact the library ahead of time to ensure 
