UID:69b614838d5e2d093365608f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this follow-up class to Digital Photography Basics\, we wil
 l explore more advanced photography techniques including how to shoot insi
 de a studio setting. Users will get hands-on experience with different lig
 hting setups and camera settings.\nAttending\nDigital Photography I: The 
 Basics\nis recommended\, but not necessary.\nRegistration opens 2 weeks pr
 ior to class.\nCamera equipment will be provided for this class. Participa
 nts are also welcome to bring their own camera.\nInformation Collection No
 tice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto P
